**How to retrieve this data**

```http
GET https://www.virustotal.com/api/v3/domains/example.org/subdomains?limit=10&cursor=abc
Headers:
  x-apikey: my_api
```

The API will return a JSON payload similar to the sample above, containing only the `id` and `context_attributes` for each related subdomain. The `continuation_cursor` field (here shown as `"def"`) can be used for the next page of results.
